The following lines have issues (specifically '//' in paths).
4:libdir=${prefix}//nix/store/n9dkj2mq54idbv1qlg7szkak0ynym2vh-openmodelica-1.25.0/lib//omc/
5:includedir=${prefix}//nix/store/n9dkj2mq54idbv1qlg7szkak0ynym2vh-openmodelica-1.25.0/include/omc//cminpack-1
It is very likely that paths are being joined improperly.
ex: "${prefix}/@CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR@" should be "@CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_LIBDIR@"



OMCompiler-3rdParty/blob/master/CMinpack/CMakeLists.txt:
change
set(CMINPACK_LIB_INSTALL_DIR ${CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR})
to
set(CMINPACK_LIB_INSTALL_FULL_LIBDIR ${CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_LIBDIR})

cminpack.pc.in:
change
libdir=${prefix}/@CMINPACK_LIB_INSTALL_DIR@
to
libdir=@CMINPACK_LIB_INSTALL_FULL_LIBDIR@

same for include


